ic.com/U447IH35/as/rzqvtrhfs9w6pncq8q7g4k2b/4000383457-847__5?auto=webp\\u0026format=jpg\\u0026width=800\\u0026height=800\\u0026fit=bounds\",\"https://bfasset.costco-static.com/U447IH35/as/htp65kxwfwmvbv6f23kb9z/4000383457-847__6?auto=webp\\u0026format=jpg\\u0026width=800\\u0026height=800\\u0026fit=bounds\",\"https://bfasset.costco-static.com/U447IH35/as/4vrc46vg9t86jwvk598hz/4000383457-847__7?auto=webp\\u0026format=jpg\\u0026width=800\\u0026height=800\\u0026fit=bounds\"]},\"summary\":{\"title\":\"Sealy Posturepedic Pro Lincoln Heights 14\\\" Firm or Plush Mattress\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":66999000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"usd\"}},\"variation_infos\":{\"tier_variations\":[{\"name\":\"Firmness\",\"options\":[\"Plush\"],\"display_indicators\":[0]},{\"name\":\"Bed Size\",\"options\":[\"Full\"],\"display_indicators\":[0]}]},\"model_infos\":{\"models\":[{\"offer_id\":\"costco-4000383457-1900572\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[0,0]}}],\"cur_model_idx\":0},\"review_data\":{\"summary\":{\"total_count\":3427,\"summary_text\":\"Most customers left positive feedback, praising the mattress for being comfortable, solid yet soft, and supportive without being too firm for side sleepers. However, some users reported issues with sagging after just a couple of weeks, while others found the firmness uncomfortable as their bodies have not yet adjusted.\",\"rating_max\":4.4164},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":336771608,\"user_name\":\"TMass\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"We love this bed!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"create_time\":1792648506},{\"comment_id\":336771596,\"user_name\":\"Iconwriter\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This mattress is very comfortable to sleep on. My only regret is that I bought a 14.5\\\" mattress rather than a Iess high mattress. I have a Victorian Eastlake bed in and with the 9\\\" box spring, it's a pretty high bed to get into. Luckily I was gifted a two stair mahogany riser so I can climb in without too much difficulty. So far, my elderly cat can still jump up. He loves the mattress and happily sleeps on it and takes frequent daily naps.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1792627986},{\"comment_id\":336771590,\"user_name\":\"Barb\",\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"Needed to down size my mattress\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1792620582},{\"comment_id\":336771598,\"user_name\":\"Jaybird\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I have a 50 year history with Sealy and would not have anything but. I learned Costco had what I wanted through ChatGPT\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1792607214},{\"comment_id\":336771610,\"user_name\":\"ZxG1\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I bought two queens for my kids and they love it.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1792606894}]},\"item_details\":{\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\nSealy Posturepedic Pro Lincoln Heights mattress\\n14-inch height available in Firm or Plush\\nMoistureProtect Cover with Surface-Guard Technology\\nSealyComfort Gel Memory Foam and Gel Foam layers\\nSealySupport Gel Foam and MaxSupport Technology\\nPrecisionFit Coils with Duraflex Coil Edge\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nThis Sealy Posturepedic Pro Lincoln Heights mattress features a 14-inch profile designed in Firm or Plush firmness. It combines SealyComfort Gel Memory Foam and SealyComfort Gel Foam with SealySupport Gel Foam and MaxSupport Technology for targeted support. The PrecisionFit Coils provide a tailored fit, while the Duraflex Coil Edge enhances durability.\\nMaterials \\u0026 Craftsmanship\\nThe mattress includes a MoistureProtect Cover with Surface-Guard Technology. It is constructed with SealyComfort Gel Memory Foam, SealyComfort Gel Foam, SealySupport Gel Foam, and PrecisionFit Coils. The edge support utilizes Duraflex Coil Edge technology.\\nDimensions/Packaging\\nThe coil count varies by size: 930 coils for Full, 1066 for Queen, 1320 for King, and 1337 for California King.\"}]},