t coils \\u0026 MaxSupport tech maintain mattress support.\\n- **Comfort:** gel memory foam and gel foam layers cushion the body.\\n- **Drier Sleep:** a MoistureProtect cover helps keep sleep drier.\",\"product_tags\":[{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Supportive\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Comfortable\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Drier\"}],\"like_info\":{\"state\":1,\"item_id\":null,\"cspu_id\":null,\"country\":\"US\",\"state_version\":\"0\"}}}","at":1792812315569,"synthetic":1},{"k":"fetch","m":"POST","u":"https://sg.migoo.test.shopee.io/beeai/api/v1/pdp/info","b":"{\"region\":\"US\",\"cspu_id\":\"100000018452850\",\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16805560281\"}","s":200,"ct":"application/json; charset=utf-8","t":"{\"code\":0,\"message\":\"success\",\"results\":{\"request_id\":\"27f50260-6b54-4f4e-a95b-59abf07fe446\",\"region\":\"US\",\"agg_level\":4,\"item_id\":0,\"shop_id\":0,\"cspu_id\":\"100000018452850\",\"model_id\":0,\"hero_media\":{\"product_image_id\":[\"https://cf.shopee.sg/file/sg-11134327-823ot-mopcopxojzswf6\",\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/6dea5763-02c8-4ec3-b11e-83cf7d518ced.38c4fdadb83a44244c68ef73e57b8ae3.jpeg\",\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/10c1d016-bb4e-4623-83ca-21404ae1e6b2.3b2c1a3885c879f3449cd1f5e1707ca3.jpeg\",\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/8db878f0-5252-4718-8475-20d6f4945ed6.e903418388c9022cedad838ce812762a.jpeg\",\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/cf515f88-5596-4e53-bab3-422b80d1dfe9.5bad957d81871dec49bda360909fda78.jpeg\",\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/4e3b4e78-afa2-4bc7-be46-9df500f66e00.77c2a1828214ae7acbb5e3dc5cf8c02b.jpeg\",\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/ec0c122f-bea3-4d1c-a6e3-3a7b2e272d24.c4adbfb6b8ac271711949c8d96b3e426.jpeg\",\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/bfb152c7-a603-459a-80ea-ef6028ee5a2c.8b88911ff155b5e569f8edb33c388fc7.jpeg\"]},\"summary\":{\"title\":\"Mainstays Large Flex Laundry Tote, EVA Plastic, 18 in W x 8.75 in D x 13 in H, Soft Silver\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":1994000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"usd\"}},\"variation_infos\":{\"tier_variations\":[{\"name\":\"Actual Color\",\"options\":[\"Mint\",\"Red Sedona\",\"Silver\",\"Iris Whisper\",\"Blue\",\"Indigo\",\"Water\",\"Lemonade\"],\"display_indicators\":[2,0,0,0,2,0,2,2]}]},\"model_infos\":{\"models\":[{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16738322896\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[0]}},{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16784462379\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[1]}},{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16805560281\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[2]}},{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16776253492\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[3]}},{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16815155231\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[4]}},{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16761900096\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[5]}},{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16787507996\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[6]}},{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16815155230\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[7]}}],\"cur_model_idx\":2},\"review_data\":{\"summary\":{\"total_count\":5930,\"summary_text\":\"88% of customers left positive feedback. Shoppers particularly appreciate the high capacity, noting the bags easily hold a large bottle of liquid detergent, two big containers of laundry beads, a large bottle of fabric softener, and a big box of XL dryer sheets with room to spare. Many also value the good price, reporting they found these bags at Walmart for $20 and online at an even better rate. A smaller number of reviewers mention the twisted handle and the fact that the bags show dirt.\",\"rating_max\":4.7},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":332982702,\"user_name\":\"Carol\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I noticed low ratings and pictures about twisted handles. All you have to do is spin one end of a handle to fix it (or unsnap it)!! The bag is EXCELLENT and what a great value!!! I bought 2 to use as grocery bags and they are perfect and I was stopped by other shoppers wanting to know where I got them. I might give a few for Christmas!!\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"create_time\":1789862400},{\"comment_id\":332982703,\"user_name\":\"JeanneA\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I dont use it as a \\\"laundry tote\\\" as it is described but as a general use tote. It is very thick and heavy, so far seems sturdy, and holds everything I need it to. It stands upright very well. It is an affordable alternative to the fancy name brand totes. I will be ordering more to use as reusable gift bags, as the tote itself is a gift itself!\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1789776000},{\"comment_id\":288078094,\"user_name\":\"Amber\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I've had this bag over the summer and used it for a swim tote — it has been amazing! It looks/functions like the fancy brand one at half the cost. Super easy to clean, holds all the awkward things, easy to carry handles, and doesn't collapse when you set it down. I'm in love. Thank you Walmart!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1788220800},{\"comment_id\":288078131,\"user_name\":\"Terry\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I am very happy with the size and sturdiness of this tote for collecting whites. I find sorting dirty laundry to be one of the more distasteful household chores, so sorting it as it's used makes that job almost nonexistent. Everything that can tolerate bleach goes into this white basket. I would have also gotten the turquois one that the call \\\"water\\\" if it had been in stock. I will keep checking back because the handles make this convenient for toting it on my shoulder while making my way around the house-- both before and after laundering the contents. I also appreciate the sturdy, yet flexible, sides. That's something few laundry baskets have.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1788048000},{\"comment_id\":288078095,\"user_name\":\"Amy\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This is the second one I purchased. I cannot justify the name brands massive price tag for what the material is. The colors are bright, the bag has a lot of storage. It was perfect for tball and baseball season and easy to clean. The handles were long enough to fit on my shoulder, but the more you load it up the heavier it gets. Never had an issue with the handles. Will buy more as gifts.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1787184000}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Volume capacity\",\"value\":\"5 cu in\"},{\"name\":\"Features\",\"value\":\"Carrying Handles\"},{\"name\":\"Material\",\"value\":\"Plastic\"},{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"Silver\"},{\"name\":\"Laundry basket, sorter \\u0026 hamper type\",\"value\":\"Laundry Hampers\"},{\"name\":\"Shape\",\"value\":\"Rectangle\"},{\"name\":\"Height\",\"value\":\"13 in\"},{\"name\":\"Size descriptor\",\"value\":\"Slim\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Mainstays\"},{\"name\":\"Decor style\",\"value\":\"Transitional\"},{\"name\":\"Pattern\",\"value\":\"Solid Print\"},{\"name\":\"Number of bins\",\"value\":\"1\"},{\"name\":\"Care and maint\",\"value\":\"Wipe with dry cloth\"},{\"name\":\"Assembly req\",\"value\":\"N\"},{\"name\":\"Accessories\",\"value\":\"Additional clips\"},{\"name\":\"Finish\",\"value\":\"Soft Silver\"},{\"name\":\"Piece count\",\"value\":\"1\"},{\"name\":\"Retail packaging\",\"value\":\"Single Piece\"},{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"value\":\"5 lb\"},{\"name\":\"Has written warranty\",\"value\":\"No\"},{\"name\":\"Suggested number of people for assembly\",\"value\":\"0\"},{\"name\":\"Age group\",\"value\":\"Adult\"}],\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\nMainstays Large All Purpose Flex Laundry Tote in Pink Blush\\nWaterproof and washable durable flexible plastic construction\\n18\\\" W x 8.75\\\" D x 13\\\" H dimensions with up to 40 lbs capacity\\nTwo sturdy shoulder straps and 2 extra clips included\\nAvailable in Orchid Bloom, Melon Juice, Teal Dream, and Blue Isle\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nThe Mainstays Flexible Laundry Tote is designed for organizing closets, carrying dirty clothes, and daily household activities. It features two sturdy straps for hands-free shoulder carrying.\\nMaterials \\u0026 Craftsmanship\\nConstructed from durable flexible plastic, the tote is waterproof and machine washable. Plastic liners are recommended when carrying liquids, lotions, or sunscreens to prevent staining.\\nCare Instructions\\nExcessive heat can cause misshaping or warping. If this occurs, soak the tote in warm water and leave it in the sun to restore its original shape.\\nDimensions/Packaging\\nThe tote measures 18 inches wide, 13 inches high, and 8.75 inches deep. The package includes 2 extra clips for the straps.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"walmart-16805560281\",\"product_id\":120000084945308,\"cspu_id\":\"100000018452850\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/MS-FLEX-TOTE-SOFT-SILVER/16805560281\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":1994000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Walmart.com\",\"supplier_rating\":4.7,\"website\":\"walmart\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-824ij-mput674daadqbc\",\"video_urls\":[\"https://i5-richmedia.walmartimages.com/asr-rm/7df0a7f7-d463-478f-8a36-788825f087c5_video_walmart.mp4\"],\"review_data\":{\"featured_reviews\":[{\"user_name\":\"Amy\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This is the second one I purchased. I cannot justify the name brands massive price tag for what the material is. The colors are bright, the bag has a lot of storage. It was perfect for tball and baseball season and easy to clean. The handles were long enough to fit on my shoulder, but the more you load it up the heavier it gets. Never had an issue with the handles. Will buy more as gifts.\"},{\"user_name\":\"anonymous\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I'd been wanting a bag of this style for some time to use for soccer games. I was not paying a high price just for the color I wanted. This bag...this bag here is amazing. It is HUGE!!! The price was awesome. I did get it about $5 cheaper ordering online, vs just getting it in store. The bag holds a couple of 50x60 throws, my kindle, water, snacks, and on occasion my Nikon DSLR and zoom lens. It wipes clean fairly easy and I don't have to worry about it falling over. It is so sturdy and stays upright. Definitely recommend. Don't pay a high price for the same quality as this bag. You'd be wasting your money.\\nI have included a regular sized novel for size comparison. (Novel is available on Amazon). 😉\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"user_name\":\"VaBeach\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This is a fabulous thick sturdy bag. I've been using all summer to take drinks and gardening supplies in and out of the house all summer. And then I can just as soon dump all that out and put all the pool stuff in the bag to take to the pool. And then, of course, I can dump all that out and put my pocketbook, some drinks —get in the car for a day of shopping or whatever. It's an all round bag I will use for the rest of my life.\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"user_name\":\"jennifer\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I got this MS Large tote on sale. I love these totes to use as gift bags. I have several and I have given many as friendship gifts/baby gifts stuffed with necessities. I keep one - two in the back of my SUV for safe keeping of items in the back after shopping or taking items for a visit. I own a Bogg and this MS tote isn't as thick/or sturdy in general/for sure the handles/but the cost is so affordable! I would highly recommend these MS Totes...I have bought different sizes on the web site and have had good luck colors/cost %26 the recipients loving them. Especially little girls!\",\"sort_order\":3},{\"user_name\":\"Tamera\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I wanted a heavy duty swim tote! One that would not blow away or into the pool. This is the perfect weight, waterproof, handles with replaceable attachments. Plenty of room for a kick board, fins, towels, water weights. Water bottles. Would also work for water aerobics! I am so excited! Looks easy to wash out!\",\"sort_order\":4}]}},\"rcmd_reason_tag\":[\"Hands-Free\",\"Organized\",\"Durable\"],\"rcmd_reason\":[\"Hands-Free Carry: two sturdy straps let the tote go over the shoulder.\",\"Organized Laundry: a large tote carries clothes and household items.\",\"Regular Use: soft EVA plastic is made for regular use and easy care.\"],\"rcmd_reason_markdown\":\"- **Hands-Free Carry:** two sturdy straps let the tote go over the shoulder.\\n- **Organized Laundry:** a large tote carries clothes and household items.\\n- **Regular Use:** soft EVA plastic is made for regular use and easy care.\",\"product_tags\":[{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Hands-Free\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Organized\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Durable\"}],\"like_info\":{\"state\":1,\"item_id\":null,\"cspu_id\":null,\"country\":\"US\",\"state_version\":\"0\"}}}","at":1792812316063,"synthetic":1},{"k":"fetch","m":"POST","u":"https://sg.migoo.test.shopee.io/beeai/api/v1/pdp/info","b":"{\"region\":\"US\",\"cspu_id\":\"100000018210408\",\"offer_id\":\"target-95001157\"}","s":200,"ct":"application/json; charset=utf-8","t":"{\"code\":0,\"message\":\"success\",\"results\":{\"request_id\":\"5a17aab0-0dd5-49ec-8cb8-35e6be89f983\",\"region\":\"US\",\"agg_level\":4,\"item_id\":0,\"shop_id\":0,\"cspu_id\":\"100000018210408\",\"model_id\":0,\"hero_media\":{\"product_image_id\":[\"https://cf.shopee.sg/file/sg-11134327-8257u-mt8hsu26z9c200\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_c611073e-fe54-4d40-b42b-7e854091fcf1\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_89dac808-6c5a-4ce0-b999-55971d68c298\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_0ef69367-58cc-43a3-9e4d-668b6b0a848f\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_33018717-b78b-4658-9c44-5435bc997064\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_7b65e40f-4df5-465a-9af7-9e719f0e90d8\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_efb0fe72-17f0-43ae-b8a8-5cc14ca43e93\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_91e4264d-19e9-43ab-bde2-41e0d