,"s":200,"ct":"application/json; charset=utf-8","t":"{\"code\":0,\"message\":\"success\",\"results\":{\"request_id\":\"4650b836-17c7-473b-af1e-7ec6abe02d20\",\"region\":\"US\",\"agg_level\":4,\"item_id\":0,\"shop_id\":0,\"cspu_id\":\"100000021032564\",\"model_id\":0,\"hero_media\":{\"product_image_id\":[\"https://cf.shopee.sg/file/sg-11134327-823oh-mopu2i2i2j9q8b\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/5dd42efa-8779-48c6-b41b-92e928443ba2/69239671.jpeg\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/56a4f366-e332-4e8c-892d-13269ac975de/43097933.jpg\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/9b33bd21-6322-4d9c-8aa7-5ecbd333bd9a/43089047.jpg\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/4b4ed3a7-84eb-4a3d-9c08-d78b0396345e/43098263.jpg\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/ee5002df-f175-4482-8b03-68327eca30e5/43097935.jpg\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/3db7d6d7-eab6-4be5-985e-39ac33603aa6/43089049.jpg\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/3d125f72-2d3e-46f9-89fb-02c7fdf742e8/43098954.jpg\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/a3f8faa3-61a3-4d16-b320-7a201ea77a84/69239667.jpeg\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/6cd53ce0-6ad8-4888-b896-de18cee7f8a6/69239669.jpeg\",\"https://mobileimages.lowes.com/productimages/ce5ee1ef-b667-459c-8918-47c697407a8a/69239670.jpeg\"]},\"summary\":{\"title\":\"Gain Fireworks Beads Moonlight Breeze Scent Booster 26.5-oz\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":2698000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"usd\"}},\"variation_infos\":null,\"model_infos\":{\"models\":[{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-623384891\",\"extinfo\":{}}],\"cur_model_idx\":0},\"review_data\":{\"summary\":{\"total_count\":4565,\"summary_text\":\"100% of customers left positive feedback. Shoppers particularly praise the amazing scent, noting that the product allows you to add just a little or a lot to suit your preference. Users also highlight how easy it is to use in your laundry, though a smaller number suggest going easy until you find your personal preference. While most are satisfied, some mention that the product is not the most eco-friendly.\",\"rating_max\":4.8},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":329999832,\"user_name\":\"YuliiaC\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I've been using Gain products for years now, so I wasn't hesitant about trying this laundry scent booster . The smell is strong which is good , that made my laundry smell fresh after multiple washing cycles . The scent is floral and refreshing. The bottle is big enough which would last me for about 2 months of every day laundry . Great deal for the money !\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"create_time\":1790294400},{\"comment_id\":329999831,\"user_name\":\"ToddB\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"If you like the fresh smell of sweet fruit than you will love this Gain Moonlight Breeze Fireworks Scent Booster! I literally can smell the sweet, fresh clean fragrance on my clothes 2 weeks after being washed. It's not too strong, just enough to let me know my clothes are fresh and clean. I love that I can add more or less beads depending on how strong I want the fragrance to be. These beads don't leave any film or residue behind in the washer. The only thing I notice is my washer smells nice and clean too!\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1790294400},{\"comment_id\":329999830,\"user_name\":\"StephanieG\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Wow is all I have to say I fear I can never do my laundry now without these scent beads. I love them so much I'm sad there almost gone but best believe there on my next grocery shopping trip. I loved how they made my clothes smell so good and left them soft but especially my sheets and towels.\\nI loved going to bed and getting out of the shower and smelling their amazing scent on my sheets and towels 1000/10 for sure. In love with these scent beads\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1790294400},{\"comment_id\":329999824,\"user_name\":\"ArielD\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This Gain Moonlight Breeze Fireworks Scent Smells exactly how it sounds . Using the correct amount for the most solid clothes is important . I got the best experience while WASHING my huge bath towels . The scent is still in them from washing and doing a second rinse cycle . Storing these beads in a cool not too hot area .. the feel of my clothes after they comes out the dryer is WONDERFUL . I would highly recommend using these if you don't like a lot of scent but, just enough .\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1790121600},{\"comment_id\":317718196,\"user_name\":\"KelenC\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I love this Scent booster! It lifts my cloth, smelling fresh, clean, and long lasting without being overpowering. The moonlight breeze sent is so good. I want to smell it all day. Definitely recommend it.￼\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1788998400}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Scent\",\"value\":\"Moonlight Breeze\"},{\"name\":\"Scent family\",\"value\":\"Fresh\"},{\"name\":\"Net content statement\",\"value\":\"26.5 oz\"},{\"name\":\"Features\",\"value\":\"Concentrated\"},{\"name\":\"Cleanser form\",\"value\":\"Beads\"},{\"name\":\"Product line\",\"value\":\"Fireworks\"},{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"It's as Easy as: shake a little or a lot into the cap; toss into the washer at the beginning of the wash. Enjoy the lasting fresh scent!\"},{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"value\":\"1.89 lb\"}],\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Light up your senses and blast off with our most intense scent in Midnight Bloom. Release a lively fragrance with an undeniable perfume of jasmine, amber, and Floral richness all-day long. Our perfume capsules release this delightful Gain scent from sunrise to sunset and keep your clothes fresh for up to 12 weeks from wash to wear. Gain Fireworks In-Wash Scent Booster Midnight Bloom is friendly with any fabric and for an even bigger sniff, you use it with any of our other Gain Midnight Bloom products.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"walmart-623384891\",\"product_id\":120000133446180,\"cspu_id\":\"100000021032564\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Gain-Fireworks-Moonlight-Breeze-26-5-oz-In-Wash-Scent-Booster-Beads/623384891\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":2698000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Peak Sales\",\"supplier_rating\":4.8,\"website\":\"walmart\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-824ij-mput674daadqbc\",\"review_data\":{\"featured_reviews\":[{\"user_name\":\"DanielaR\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I'm really impressed!The scent is fresh ,clean,and has a soft florar fragrance that lasts for days . My clothes smell amazing even after being stored in the closet.\"},{\"user_name\":\"MileinyR\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Love this scent booster! It leaves my clothes smelling intense fresh and amazing for days. Highly recommend! The product in instructions are clean\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"user_name\":\"HollyK\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I have turned almost everything into a routine, multiple products for everyday tasks. Scent boosters are one of my very favorites things to add to my washing. Gain has some of the best scents on the market in my opinion. I add less than a cap full of the beads to the water and laundry detergent and when they are done drying, they smell so good. Scent beads are one best things ever.\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"user_name\":\"TrishaP\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Ok I'm a little obsessed with these scent beads. This is a great value at this price point, purchasing the same thing in-store can run you nearly twice as much. The fragrance is delish but not overpowering, and it's nice to be able to control the level of fragrance desired by using more or less. I do 2-3 loads of laundry/week and this jar lasts a solid 2 months. It works well on everything, it even managed to accomplish the monumental task of making the dog beds smell fresh and clean. 11/10 recommend.\",\"sort_order\":3},{\"user_name\":\"AmandaM\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I am such a gain girl I love this scent and love how fresh every load of laundry is after using my gain fireworks. I haven't found a gain scent I don't like.\",\"sort_order\":4}]}},\"rcmd_reason_tag\":[\"Fresh\",\"Long Lasting\",\"Refreshing\"],\"rcmd_reason\":[\"Fresh Scent Boost: Scent Booster boosts freshness in laundry.\",\"Longer-Lasting Scent: a 48-hour scent booster keeps scent longer.\",\"Refreshed Laundry: Moonlight Breeze provides a fresh scent.\"],\"rcmd_reason_markdown\":\"- **Fresh Scent Boost:** Scent Booster boosts freshness in laundry.\\n- **Longer-Lasting Scent:** a 48-hour scent booster keeps scent longer.\\n- **Refreshed Laundry:** Moonlight Breeze provides a fresh scent.\",\"product_tags\":[{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Fresh\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Long Lasting\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Refreshing\"}],\"like_info\":{\"state\":1,\"item_id\":null,\"cspu_id\":null,\"country\":\"US\",\"state_version\":\"0\"}}}","at":1792812316186,"synthetic":1},{"k":"fetch","m":"POST","u":"https://sg.migoo.test.shopee.io/beeai/api/v1/pdp/info","b":"{\"region\":\"US\",\"cspu_id\":\"100000012745141\",\"offer_id\":\"amazon-B0FS9VZVX4-B0FKPD1TF9\"}","s":200,"ct":"application/json; charset=utf-8","t":"{\"code\":0,\"message\":\"success\",\"results\":{\"request_id\":\"d1b7e552-8a11-43ce-916d-947c4bd212b4\",\"region\":\"US\",\"agg_level\":4,\"item_id\":0,\"shop_id\":0,\"cspu_id\":\"100000012745141\",\"model_id\":0,\"hero_media\":{\"product_image_id\":[\"https://cf.shopee.sg/file/sg-11134327-823pf-mote25kkw2dd74\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mbRKLMAiL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712nUKsBXaL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kdO4VhGGL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vD1P3fXLL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.me