 YOUR inner child will thank you too. *You can also add cut up strawberries for a fancier popsicle. This is me recommending a product I truly enjoy… just leave some for me.\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"user_name\":\"Diane\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I used to drink a lot of Gatorade and power AIDS. I quit drinking those and I started drinking the vitamin water, I like it a lot. The taste is good the aftertaste, there isn't any they're just really refreshing and good. I recommend the dragon fruit and I also recommend the blueberry acia pomegranate. They are both great for summers.They do not disappoint\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"user_name\":\"Stephanie\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Perfect drink during pregnancy. Especially when water just won't cut it but you don't want tons of sugar. I don't drink sugar during pregnancy or eat it so it's important to me to have healthy substitutions without all the fuzz and unhealthy by products in zero sugar products. This drink doesn't taste sugary at all\",\"sort_order\":3},{\"user_name\":\"ACALLY\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Having a hard time staying hydrated these days..figure since I get bored of water, these would be an incentive to drink more. They are good, but adding a lot of sugar into my diet. They do make zero sugar, I'll try those next. If they're too much like kid's juice for you, mix half and half with water.\",\"sort_order\":4}]}},\"cheapest_info\":{\"content\":\"Cheapest in 30 days\",\"chart\":{\"type\":1,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"window_days\":30,\"date_list\":[1790265600,1790352000,1790438400,1790524800,1790611200,1790697600,1790784000,1790870400,1790956800,1791043200,1791129600,1791216000,1791302400,1791388800,1791475200,1791561600,1791648000,1791734400,1791820800,1791907200,1791993600,1792080000,1792166400,1792252800,1792339200,1792425600,1792512000,1792598400,1792812317],\"price_list\":[717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,717000,1552000,1552000,1